@startuml gold-status-common
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
title Gold-status: end-to-end преобразование в QoS-политику

actor "Gold subscriber\nUE" as UE
database "BSS/CRM\ncommercial status:\ngold/silver/bronze" as BSS
database "Subscriber DB\nLTE: HSS\n5G: UDM/UDR" as SUB
database "Policy control\nLTE: PCRF\n5G: PCF" as POL
rectangle "Session control\nLTE: MME/P-GW\n5G: AMF/SMF" as SESSION
rectangle "User-plane enforcement\nLTE: P-GW/PCEF\n5G: UPF/QER" as UP
rectangle "RAN enforcement\nLTE: eNodeB\n5G: gNB" as RAN
rectangle "IP/MPLS edge\nDSCP, queues,\nDPI, CGNAT" as IP
cloud "Internet / IMS /\nEnterprise / MEC" as DN

BSS --> SUB : entitlement,\nprofile, AMBR
BSS --> POL : policy group,\nQoS template
SUB --> SESSION : subscription data
POL --> SESSION : QCI/5QI, ARP,\nAMBR, GBR/GFBR,\nAPN/DNN/slice
SESSION --> UP : bearer/session rules
SESSION --> RAN : radio QoS context
UE --> RAN : radio access
RAN --> UP : user plane tunnel
UP --> IP : DSCP/shaping/routing
IP --> DN

note right of RAN
Базовая станция обычно не видит
"gold" как бизнес-статус.
Она видит технический QoS:
QCI/5QI, ARP, GBR/GFBR,
AMBR and scheduler profile.
end note
@enduml
